 				<p epub:type="z3998:valediction">“Yours gratefully, <span epub:type="z3998:signature">Telemachus</span>.”</p>
 			</blockquote>
 			<p>“Good boy! I’m glad he’s gone,” said Amy, with an approving smile; the next minute her face fell as she glanced about the empty room, adding, with an involuntary sigh⁠—“Yes, I <em>am</em> glad, but how I shall miss him!”</p>
